  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Aggressive/Violent Nature",
  "description": "A racist trope that falsely claims Black people are inherently violent or criminal, often used to justify discrimination, police brutality, or to scapegoat Black communities for civil unrest. This stereotype is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it attempts to delegitimize the legitimate protest of the Black community by implying that African American leaders were orchestrating violence.",
